{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-12-05 10:05:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK EXPANDS SOUTHEAST MARKET PRESENCE INTO SOUTH CAROLINA, GEORGIA', 'text': 'DALLAS , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DEMONSTRATING ITS COMMITMENT TO DRIVING GROWTH THROUGH STRATEGIC INVESTMENTS, COMERICA BANK ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF ITS NEW SOUTHEAST MARKET WITH THE RECENT ADDITION OF OFFICES IN TWO STATES NEW TO ITS REGIONAL FOOTPRINT – SOUTH CAROLINA AND GEORGIA. EXPANSION ACROSS THE SOUTHEAST HAS REMAINED A FOCUS FOR COMERICA SINCE IT REVEALED THE CREATION OF ITS SOUTHEAST MARKET IN AUGUST 2021.'}